Linus,

please pull sound fixes for v2.6.37-final from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git for-linus

Unlike my previous expectation, as usual, there is again another update
just before the final.  One trivial security fix and a quirk addition,
and the rest large (but flat) changes are for the last-minute fixes of
ASoC cache issues.  These are pretty local and shouldn't bring any
serious regressions.


Thanks!

Takashi

===

Dan Rosenberg (1):
      sound: Prevent buffer overflow in OSS load_mixer_volumes

Daniel T Chen (1):
      ALSA: hda: Use LPIB quirk for Dell Inspiron m101z/1120

